# Add these non-secret absolute coordinates to the existing P1/P2 pilot env values.
# Use only with deploy/p2/service.compose.yaml after both P1 and P2 Compose files.
# Provision SMTP outside the checkout; initialize/bind the journal before using this overlay.
# The journal initializer requires a non-existent child directory under a protected parent.
# Once initialized, both bind sources must exist; Compose must not create missing paths.
# Protect their parent directories with mode 0700; UID 1000 must be able to traverse them.
# SMTP JSON: mode 0600, readable by runtime UID 1000; provision credentials separately.
# Journal directory: owner 1000:1000, mode 0700, readable and writable by UID 1000.
# Bind mounts preserve host permissions; Compose does not repair UID or mode.
P2_SMTP_CONFIG_FILE=/var/lib/yuban-p1/private/account-smtp.json
P2_ACCOUNT_JOURNAL_DIR=/var/lib/yuban-p1/account-erasure-journal
